@startuml
title BFD - Chuc nang quan ly phim

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #475569
    FontColor #0F172A
}

rectangle "Quan ly phim" as Movie #E3F2FD
rectangle "Them phim" as Create #ECFDF5
rectangle "Cap nhat phim" as Update #ECFDF5
rectangle "Xoa mem phim" as Delete #FEE2E2
rectangle "Tim kiem / loc phim" as Search #FFFBEB
rectangle "Quan ly trang thai phim" as Status #FFFBEB
rectangle "Quan ly thong tin hien thi" as Display #F3E8FF

Movie --> Create
Movie --> Update
Movie --> Delete
Movie --> Search
Movie --> Status
Movie --> Display

Search --> "Loc theo ten, the loai,\ntrang thai, phim dang chieu"
Status --> "NOW_SHOWING\nCOMING_SOON\nENDED"
Display --> "Poster, trailer, dao dien,\ndien vien, ngon ngu, do tuoi"

note bottom
Neu database chua co bang the_loai rieng,
khong nen ve "Quan ly the loai" nhu mot module doc lap.
Nen ghi la "Tim kiem/loc theo the loai".
end note

@enduml

